    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The Qing Mao chapters do not name a cultivation path for this Gu.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Bai Ning Bing possessed Northern Dark Ice Soul Physique, the Gu worms she had included ice blade Gu, icicle Gu, water shield Gu, blue bird ice coffin Gu, ice muscles Gu, and frost demon Gu. Those worms belonged to ice and water series and complemented each other when paired.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ice-and-water-series-mention",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_northern_dark_ice_soul_physique",
          "gu_ice_blade_gu",
          "gu_icicle_gu",
          "gu_water_shield_gu",
          "gu_ice_muscles_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Shang Clan City, Wei Yang names Frost Demon Gu, Snow Fairy Gu, and Ice Crystal Gu as the three most famous ice path transformation type Gu,",
        "chapters": [
          275
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ice-path-transformation-set",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_wei_yang",
          "gu_snow_fairy_gu",
          "gu_ice_crystal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "and he says ice path’s advantage lies in defense. Wei Yang also states that Frost Demon Gu and Snow Fairy Gu are for women, while Ice Crystal Gu is more suited for men.",
        "chapters": [
          275
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ice-path-transformation-set",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing still had lingering feeling for the destroyed Qing Mao copy, then chose Ice Crystal Gu instead of Frost Demon Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          275
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ice-path-transformation-set",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a rank three Gu worm.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing refined that copy after three failures and a large spend of resources; after it is gone, Blue Bird Ice Coffin Gu is the only rank three Gu left in that set.",
        "chapters": [
          140
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_blue_bird_ice_coffin_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing later says Wood Charm Gu is harder to refine than Frost Demon Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          141
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wood_charm_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited chapter describes the Gu worm’s resting look in the aperture, or gives a Chinese name or glyph. In the Qing Mao fight Bai Ning Bing holds it in the right palm when pouring primeval essence into it.",
        "chapters": [
          139
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It lets a person transform into the frost demon, and the text places that value on par with Wood Charm Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          143
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Overuse harms the user. Fang Yuan’s early read is that light overuse brings joint problems and heavier overuse can freeze and damage muscle, so other Gu are needed beside it.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Extended use dwindles life force until the Gu Master turns into an ice statue. Bai Ning Bing knew that limit and did not push the Gu as far as Gu Yue Qing Shu pushed Wood Charm Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          143
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "char_gu_yue_qing_shu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With ice muscles that can take frost cold, the Gu and those muscles complement each other.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing can also spend remaining primeval essence to self-detonate the Gu in the palm, sacrificing the right arm and flooding the path with frost.",
        "chapters": [
          139
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Cited chapters do not show a full-body frost demon form on screen. The Qing Mao ice-arm strike Fang Yuan attributes to Frost Demon Gu is the closest: the right hand and forearm turn into transparent blue frosty ice with finger bones visible, then recover fleshy form after the kill.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The later palm detonation again turns the right arm’s muscles into light blue ice before the arm explodes.",
        "chapters": [
          139
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
