  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On Qing Mao Mountain, Fang Yuan guesses that Bai Ning Bing used rank three Frost Demon Gu for the ice arm strike that killed Xiong Li. He rates the Gu as strong among rank three, and he stays out of personal reach because even White Jade Gu would not hold that attack.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_xiong_li",
          "gu_white_jade_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s read of the valley fight is that Bai Ning Bing is already running Frost Demon Gu; the confirmed act is the later self-detonation that breaks the path when Qing Shu’s group and Fang Yuan close in.",
        "chapters": [
          137
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-ning-bings-qing-mao-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After breaking out of the ice, Bai Ning Bing names that sacrifice among the losses forced in the fight, and treats the Gu as gone.",
        "chapters": [
          140
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-ning-bings-qing-mao-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later still ranks Frost Demon Gu as the most valuable worm in Bai Ning Bing’s set when he uses Plunder Gu, but by then that copy has already been sacrificed.",
        "chapters": [
          143
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-ning-bings-qing-mao-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_plunder_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
